msgid ""
"We heard you were looking for our former shield maintenance technician, "
"Maria Shrivner who's been publishing hints about advances in shield "
"technology. We've been looking for her. We only just found out that she left "
"the station after a severe romantic breakup with her supervisor. She took a "
"job on a freighter %s which was last reported in %s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_55_defenderHunter.lua:5106
#: scripts/scenario_55_defenderHunter.lua:5118
#, lua-format
msgctxt "MariaOrders-comms"
msgid "Meet transport %s last reported in %s to find Maria Shrivner"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_55_defenderHunter.lua:5116
#, lua-format
msgctxt "Maria-shipLog"
msgid ""
"We received word that station %s has been destroyed. However, in some of "
"their final records we see that Maria Shrivner left the station to take a "
"job on freighter %s which was last reported in %s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_55_defenderHunter.lua:5125
#, lua-format
msgctxt "Maria-shipLog"
msgid ""
"Station %s has been destroyed leaving no hints for shield upgrade followup"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_55_defenderHunter.lua:5140
#, lua-format
msgctxt "MariaOrdersAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Maria Shrivner] It was tragic that %s was destroyed. Bring me to %s and "
"I'll double %s's shield effectiveness"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_55_defenderHunter.lua:5143
#: scripts/scenario_55_defenderHunter.lua:5181
#: scripts/scenario_55_defenderHunter.lua:5196
msgctxt "MariaOrders-comms"
msgid "Return to home base with Maria Shrivner to double shield capacity"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_55_defenderHunter.lua:5158
#, lua-format
msgctxt "MariaOrdersAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Maria Shrivner] I should not have broken up with him, it was all a "
"misunderstanding. Help me get him some rare material as a gift and I'll "
"double %s's shield effectiveness"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_55_defenderHunter.lua:5162
#, lua-format
msgctxt "MariaOrders-comms"
msgid ""
"Get gold, platinum, dilithium, tritanium or cobalt and bring it and Maria "
"Shrivner to %s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_55_defenderHunter.lua:5178
#, lua-format
msgctxt "MariaOrdersAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Maria Shrivner] Well, he's at least thinking about it. He liked the gift. "
"Take me to %s and let's get those shields upgraded"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_55_defenderHunter.lua:5191
#, lua-format
msgctxt "Maria-shipLog"
msgid "We were just notified that station %s has been destroyed"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_55_defenderHunter.lua:5193
#, lua-format
msgctxt "MariaOrdersAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Maria Shrivner] Oh no! I'm too late! Now we'll never be reconciled. *sniff* "
"Well, the least I can do is upgrade %s's shields. Take me there and I'll "
"double %s's shield capacity"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_55_defenderHunter.lua:5221
#, lua-format
msgctxt "MariaAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Maria Shrivner] %s's shield capacity has been doubled. They should charge "
"up to their new capacity eventually"
msgstr ""

